---
import PlatformLayout from "../../layouts/PlatformLayout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<PlatformLayout title="Security" description="Report Kéire Engine, Hub, website, authentication, package, and Marketplace security issues responsibly.">
    <section class="platform-section"><div class="platform-shell product-details"><article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Responsible disclosure</p><h1>Report vulnerabilities privately.</h1><p class="lead">Do not place exploitable details, credentials, private packages, or proof-of-concept malware in public issues.</p><h2>Include useful evidence</h2><p>Provide the affected version and platform, component or endpoint, reproduction steps, impact, relevant logs with secrets removed, and whether the issue is currently being exploited.</p><h2>Package emergencies</h2><p>Identify the product, version, SHA-256, suspected behavior, and safe indicators. Staff can security-revoke an exact immutable version while preserving unrelated entitlements.</p><h2>Current channel</h2><p>Until a branded security mailbox and response SLA pass the launch gate, use GitHub's private vulnerability reporting form. The repository security policy remains the scope authority.</p><p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/hcfgod/KeireEngine/security/advisories/new">Report privately ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/hcfgod/KeireEngine/security/policy">Read security policy ↗</a></p></article><aside class="notice-panel"><strong>Never send</strong><p>Passwords, refresh tokens, service-role keys, signing private keys, or unrelated personal information.</p></aside></div></section>
</PlatformLayout>
